@baseUrl = http://localhost:5100
@email = demo@creditcard.app
@password = Demo1234!

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Login con el usuario demo (seed)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Login inválido -> 401 ProblemDetails (code: Auth.InvalidCredentials)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "incorrecta"
}

### Usuario dueño del token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Endpoint protegido sin token -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cards

### Listar tarjetas (DTO del módulo: brand "Visa", status "Active", sin enmascarar)
# @name cards
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cards
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
@firstCardId = {{cards.response.body.$[0].id}}

### Obtener una tarjeta
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cards/{{firstCardId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear tarjeta (Visa de prueba que pasa Luhn)
# @name createCard
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cards
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardNumber": "4012 8888 8888 1881",
  "holderName": "Usuario Demo",
  "nickname": "Tarjeta de prueba",
  "expiryMonth": 12,
  "expiryYear": 2029,
  "creditLimit": 2500
}

###
@newCardId = {{createCard.response.body.$.id}}

### Crear tarjeta con número inválido -> 400 (code: Card.InvalidNumber)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cards
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardNumber": "4111 1111 1111 1112",
  "holderName": "Usuario Demo",
  "expiryMonth": 12,
  "expiryYear": 2029,
  "creditLimit": 1000
}

### Actualizar titular, alias y cupo
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cards/{{newCardId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "holderName": "Usuario Demo",
  "nickname": "Supermercado",
  "creditLimit": 3000
}

### Pago aprobado
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardId": "{{newCardId}}",
  "amount": 125.50,
  "merchant": "Supermercado Central"
}

### Pago rechazado por cupo insuficiente (se registra con status "Declined")
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardId": "{{newCardId}}",
  "amount": 99999,
  "merchant": "Concesionaria"
}

### Bloquear tarjeta
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cards/{{newCardId}}/block
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Desbloquear tarjeta
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cards/{{newCardId}}/unblock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Historial de pagos (paginado)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Historial filtrado por tarjeta
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments?cardId={{newCardId}}&page=1&pageSize=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Eliminar tarjeta con pagos aprobados en los últimos 30 días -> 422 (code: Card.HasRecentPayments)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cards/{{newCardId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear una tarjeta sin pagos para poder eliminarla
# @name disposableCard
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cards
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cardNumber": "5105 1051 0510 5100",
  "holderName": "Usuario Demo",
  "nickname": "Desechable",
  "expiryMonth": 6,
  "expiryYear": 2029,
  "creditLimit": 500
}

###
@disposableCardId = {{disposableCard.response.body.$.id}}

### Eliminar tarjeta sin pagos recientes -> 204
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cards/{{disposableCardId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
